        rdfs:comment                   "Small memorial embroidery worked with dark brown, yellowish brown, dark bluish green, gray and white silks in cross stitch on white wool ground, central large memorial plaque with inscription, \"Thomas Lovell died Feb. 12, 1822\", under design: \"my years were only seven\", edged with pink taffeta ribbon; several small holes."@en ;
